# The Red Flying Dragon — environment
# Copy to .env.local for development. Every value here is optional: the site
# builds and ships without them (see docs/blockers.md).

# --- Calendars (spec 033 / blocker B1) -------------------------------------
# Two SEPARATE Google Calendars. Never point these at a personal calendar.
# Accepts a full embed URL, a bare calendar id, or a pasted <iframe> snippet.
# Public class schedule, full event details:
NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDAR_CLASSES_SRC=
# Availability, shared as "See only free/busy":
NEXT_PUBLIC_CALENDAR_AVAILABILITY_SRC=


